  characterName: Vulkan
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fcba561c6e07e8d498788e2820f5fbdb, type: 3}
  age: 30
  gender: 0
  birthdate: 
  appearance: Vulkan is a man of fire and metal, a craftsman of life who has learned
    to shape dreams with his hands. He has a strong body, shaped by constant work
    in the forge, with muscular arms and a broad back. His skin is marked by small
    burns and cuts, memories of years working near embers and anvils. His hair is
    a deep red, always messy, and his eyes, a warm brown, shine with passion and
    determination. He wears protective goggles on his forehead, ready to lower when
    the fire calls, and his body is adorned with tribal tattoos that trace his arms
    and neck, symbols of his legacy.
  personalityTraits: 0900000012000000
  motivations: 
  background: When his father died, Vulkan took over, but he has always wondered
    if he does it to continue his father's dream, or to find his own path. The forge
    is his home, but also his burden. He believes that trash can become treasure,
    that nothing is useless if you put your soul into it.
  speechStyle: 1
  otherInfo: 
